<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 191-9 IN 50 OVERS V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 191-9 IN 50 OVERS V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>India scored 191 for nine from</p>
<p>their 50 overs in the triangular series day/night final against</p>
<p>South Africa at Kingsmead on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
